              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egyo niyo nsi eyo mulyatira enganda za Isiraeli, kuziha obusika, kandi egyo niyo myate yayo, buli ruganda n'omwate gwarwo. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.29",
